  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sudan Free of Female Genital Mutilation Phase 2 (SFFGM2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To decrease the prevalence of Female Genital Cutting in Sudan and open space for wider programme on gender equality, supoorting SDG5. The programme will change social norms in target communities and at scale, support an improved legal environment, strengthen systems combatting FGM and other harmful practices, and catalyse a wider response to gender equality in Sudan. Primary beneficiaries will be girls and women in target communities, locations and states in Sudan.</narrative>
  </description>
